# Cline Configuration Rules

## Retry Configuration
- maxRetries: 20
- retryDelay: 30000
- ignoreRepeatedFailures: true

## Tool Call Failure Handling
- ignoreRepeatedToolCallFailures: true
- maxConsecutiveFailures: 20
- failureRetryDelay: 30000

## Warning Suppression
- suppressRepeatedToolCallFailureWarning: true
- warningRetryThreshold: 20
- warningRetryInterval: 30000